{ When in check, organize the search. Try captures of the checker, blocks of a line check, and safe king moves. A legal defense must also survive the next reply. } 1. Rxe1 { Illustrative line. Rxe1 removes the attacking rook completely. After the capture, Black has no rook left to continue checking. White has solved the immediate problem while gaining a rook. Bf1 would also block the line, but it leaves Black's rook on the board. Prefer a defense that both answers the threat and improves the resulting position when the calculation supports it. Do not stop searching just because the first legal move avoids mate. } *

[Event "Find a Defensive Resource / 07.1B"]
